{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:222","content":{"id":222,"title":"条目 #222","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"37ca98ee-6b25-4799-a4df-ef84fb424463","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道黏膜是那个生活了 1000 多种细菌，数量达三四十万亿，还有几千种病毒，组成了肠道微生物群。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cfaa00eb-dba2-40d4-8b8c-a8394500c8ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道免疫系统是一个半封闭系统，和其他部位的免疫系统保持一定界限。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dbb17ecc-6e14-4a1a-a7fe-5a078eca4ff2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道黏膜的最大挑战，它的防线一直在被攻破，要持续响应分辨敌友。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"98fb8329-5406-4393-a310-67b6b0958e5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"90% 以上人体所需营养都是在肠道吸收的，这里有大量人体必需的细菌，进一步分解食物，共生细菌。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"43a5f5b3-0d39-440e-8568-59a8199b041c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细菌有可能侵入肠道内部，如果进入血流，会带来可怕后果，所以黏膜的一大目标就是防止这种情况。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8fc250fe-0952-48a1-9abe-3064ca7217cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道黏膜有三层："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"adf1234c-49d8-4da1-bf40-5be20244cb0a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"681f5cc2-9a7e-4344-a6a9-1914f4d53859","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ecc814c4-4bc2-4f45-8fc5-f89cd7c0903e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"黏液层，内含大量抗体，防御素和杀伤细菌的蛋白质，具有一定通透性，可以让营养物质通过"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"82e58b11-563a-4068-8087-552943945179","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ffaba486-b3c9-44ea-9429-600b9fb0abea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道上皮细胞，人体内外真正的屏障"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3ef6f41f-fde7-41ff-b347-a2acf114f833","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"caa09a13-c0fd-4ddb-86ef-adbb4bf2eb76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"固有层，有特殊巨噬细胞、B 细胞和树突状细"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f5053b1-9813-439b-997a-78db69d02833","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"若非必要，免疫系统会极力避免发炎，因为发炎会导致肠道产生大量多余液体，造成腹泻，不仅会损伤上皮层，还是导致重度脱水。腹泻仍是重要死因，每年约 50 万儿童因此死去。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09c26ac1-dc1e-430e-a76f-b22b0e659815","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道的巨噬细胞的特点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1ec61aa7-a22a-48ab-8229-c55f48d72608","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f4f7eb52-80eb-4f87-b097-c33952861172","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b2b045d-3a8e-4061-aa49-27f656ce3f52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"很擅长吞噬细菌"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c58354a8-e15a-4e0c-8bb6-dd158773aba5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c424114e-fe03-484f-abdf-ec0d92f54fea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不会召集中性粒细胞而引发炎症的细胞因子"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"250d8619-2710-4c59-8ec4-84f50544a092","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道树突细胞会待在上皮细胞下面，把长触手从上皮细胞挤过去，伸入黏液进行采样，识别入侵细菌。有个谜题，树突细胞是怎么识别是危险的病原体还是共生的细菌的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4046f9ba-417e-4259-90ec-01fa011e470b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肠道的 B 细胞会生成大量的 IgA，把黏液中的细菌黏在一起，然后成为粪便的一部分，粪便的三成多都是细菌。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c54a7803-c16d-46e1-a835-221ba56e06c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果真有致命病菌经过了胃酸洗礼，来到了肠道，上述机制就是可怕的漏洞，所以在肠道上有一个“派尔集合淋巴结”，它直接长到肠道上，有微皱褶细胞深入肠壁，对感兴趣的对象采样，这样就相当拥有一个快速的免俗筛查。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"条目 #222","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:222","type":"doc","id":222}}],"prevPage":{"title":"24 沼泽之国：黏膜","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:210","type":"doc","id":210}},"nextPage":{"title":"26 病毒是什么","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:223","type":"doc","id":223}},"createTime":1741652988665,"updateTime":1743303640526,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640526}}